{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/128099-single-player-demon","id":128099,"title":"Single-player Demon","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-05-08T02:26:19-07:00","id":128099,"title":"Single-player Demon","content":"How well is Demon suited to 1-1 games (i.e. one storyteller and one player)? Quite apart from the fact that RPing is intended to be a social game generally<br /> <br /> On the one hand the fact that Demons are so secretive makes it quite likely that a Demon would not meet many other Demons or if they do that they don't form a ring. But on the other hand the Demon *game rules* seems to be designed for a social game.<br /> <br /> What good plot hooks would work for a 1-1 chronicle?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2108-genesis","name":"genesis","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-08T05:21:55-07:00","id":128160,"title":"","content":"Imagine the schemes you could come up with! Form a cult, form demon contacts, attack the machine! It can be done but more interesting and has more potential with a few at least. If you do try this 1 to 1 then I advise only one thing. Play with time quite loosely. Time to a demon or the machine is far less finite.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","name":"Mr.F.I.X.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2909_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","va